{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"532522","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/532522","key":"MC-307864","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"01/May/26 8:58 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n\n<p>A desync occurs when restarting the aging of a small sulfur cube and feeding it a slimeball afterward.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Stepstoreproduce\"></a>Steps to reproduce</h3>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Summon a small sulfur cube.</li>\n\t<li>Feed it two golden dandelions to stop and restart its aging.</li>\n\t<li>Feed it a slimeball.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Observedbehavior\"></a>Observed behavior</h3>\n\n<p>The sulfur cube will appear large. However, it will still be able to be fed golden dandelions, and when given a block client-side, it will still take damage. When reloaded, it will be small again.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedbehavior\"></a>Expected behavior</h3>\n\n<p>The sulfur cube would resemble its actual age.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><b>What’s more</b></p>\n\n<p>In creative mode,if you put the sulfur cube in a bucket, then press E twice to open and close inventory, then you can pour it out successfully, and no activity can make it young again.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"customfield_10055":null,"fixVersions":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10048":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"04/May/26 3:42 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"04/May/26 3:42 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"Small sulfur cubes become large client-side when fed a slimeball after restarting their aging","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-307864/watchers","watchCount":0,"isWatching":false},"customfield_10070":1,"customfield_10061":null,"created":"2026-05-01T20:58:48.303-0700","customfield_10050":null,"customfield_10051":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10095","value":"Expansion A","id":"10095"},"description":{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The bug"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A desync occurs when restarting the aging of a small sulfur cube and feeding it a slimeball afterward."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Steps to reproduce"}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Summon a small sulfur cube."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Feed it two golden dandelions to stop and restart its aging."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Feed it a slimeball."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Observed behavior"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The sulfur cube will appear large. However, it will still be able to be fed golden dandelions, and when given a block client-side, it will still take damage. When reloaded, it will be small again."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Expected behavior"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The sulfur cube would resemble its actual age."}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text